  "title": "Hearty Vegetarian Shepherd&#39;s Pie",
  "description": "This meatless comfort food is packed with high-antioxidant vegetables, plus curry&#39;s anti-cancer curcumin.",
  "authors": [
    "USA WEEKEND columnist Pam Anderson"
